  "description": {
    "de": "Austrias National Parks are home to large parts of the countrys biodiversity. While following regional research interests, the National Parks are committed to a joint vision and research strategy. Experienced staff address scientific questions by conducting their own research, commissioning research or working on collaborative projects. Researchers and students are encouraged to capitalize on available long-term data and to aim for an extraordinary level of scientific outreach.\n"
